From eca689423c8bdcad77e592429dbb7c455f60379b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 02:54:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] libtaskmanager: own com.canonical.Unity from plasmashell
 startup

Apps autostarted at login sent their badge count before the Task
Manager had loaded, so it was lost. Own com.canonical.Unity from the
start of plasmashell and keep each app's last entry for it to read.

BUG: 462735
---
 libtaskmanager/CMakeLists.txt           |   2 +
 libtaskmanager/unitylauncherentries.cpp | 103 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 libtaskmanager/unitylauncherentries.h   |  74 +++++++++++++++++
